              "message": "Merge pull request #4649 from storytold/fix/prefs-that-act\n\nDocs: audit which Preferences options act (G12)",
              "url": "https://github.com/Blenux/vectorcraft/commit/ee9f7e028ef558bd1408e928586a4d25affc9d26",
